 "_about": "Vox / Johnny-Harris-style palettes, energetic register (v0.8.1): one bold background, one hot accent, paper for contrast; never dull or dark-dominant openers. Themes are pre-validated (text >= 4.5:1, graphics >= 3:1). Rotated by episode number (studio.py look). Colours outside the palette (except black/white/greys) are flagged by studio.py check. Generated by build_palettes.py.",
